{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060105/block/singleImage/3247478/df/01M5QC1M2PJX6Y9FS8R5WTZFVF.jpeg?updatedAt=1792859680\"/><figcaption>YOHO West備受市場追捧，連錄租賃成交。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，天水圍新晉屋苑YOHO West備受市場追捧，連錄租賃成交，包括1期3A座高層A10室，實用面積約437 方呎，兩房間隔，向北，放盤1周即租出，月租1.6萬元，呎租約36.6元。 伍耀祖指，業主於2023年12月以522.49萬元一手買入單位，現享近3.7厘租金回報。 資料顯示，YOHO WEST位於天水圍天恩路1號，處於輕鐵天榮站上蓋，分兩期發展，共有4座，合共提供1,976伙；第1期設有2座，於2024年入伙，提供1,393伙。 即睇天水圍YOHO WEST租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T00:19:58.019693+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T00:38:51.214868+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T00:18:10.951592+00:00","content_hash":"61c555fbab3a7f498f0042c3e602f8da1c181d8a3717ee548bf66b25a41caa7f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}